<title>USA: Stokely USA Inc Q4 March 31 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Stokely USA Inc Q4 March 31 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>OCONOMOWOC, Wis. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $ 0.21     loss     $  0.47</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,437     loss	 5,331</p>
<p> Revs			35,535		   48,794</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,373		   11,326</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 loss excludes non-recurring restructuring charge of $12.5 million or $1.10 a share.</p>
<p>Lower 1997 Q4 sales reflect a decline in frozen vegetable sales as Stokely completed its exit from that business.  </p>
